{"screen_name": "kimidori_17_17", "file": "kimidori_17_17", "name": "樹碧", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2019697850771439616/zsucp70n.png", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/377251545/1768314770/1500x500", "description": "20↑二次創作絵描き／雑食雑多3L◎+女攻／icon:@fgo_takeha／濃厚CP絵+🔞絵https://poipiku.com/18418/／イラスト一覧→#kimidori_illust（過去絵少しずつタグつけていきます）原稿と仕事で忙しすぎて低浮上気味です‼️🆘", "acceptable": true, "missing": false, "total_works": 35, "scraped_works": 30, "first_seen": "2025-10-10T10:57:04.288795+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-03-02T23:49:04.147883+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 7000, "recorded_at": "2025-10-10T18:57:04.288795"}, {"amount": 8000, "recorded_at": "2026-02-16T07:39:57.988948+00:00"}], "comic": [{"amount": 9000, "recorded_at": "2025-10-10T18:57:04.288795"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 8000, "comic": 9000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 7000, "max": 8000}, "comic": {"min": 9000, "max": 9000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/kimidori_17_17", "name": "kimidori_17_17"}, {"label": "Website", "url": "https://lit.link/kimidor777", "name": ""}, {"label": "Pixiv", "url": "https://www.pixiv.net/users/2403500", "name": "2403500"}], "flags": {"from_archive": true}, "works": [{"path": "/@kimidori_17_17/works/35", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9b2dc967/uploads/origins/c1af24e6-2bed-4243-b4e7-fbd873a0ba9c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6f10baface26fb20ba47d0a114feb5d0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9b2dc967/uploads/origins/c1af24e6-2bed-4243-b4e7-fbd873a0ba9c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6f10baface26fb20ba47d0a114feb5d0, https://si.imgix.net/9b2dc967/uploads/origins/c1af24e6-2bed-4243-b4e7-fbd873a0ba9c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=439bc88a38e2be84f8736bd09cdbf42a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9b2dc967/uploads/origins/c1af24e6-2bed-4243-b4e7-fbd873a0ba9c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c13fe40bd1d089644414a12e3f00cd22 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "はじめまして！ぜひ樹碧さんに自分のオリジナルキャラクター(OC)のイラストを描いていただきたい！と思い、ご依頼をさせていただきました。\n描いていただきたいのが、TRPGのオリジナルキャラクターです。\n\n------\n\nティト・アメトリノ\n年齢：31歳\n身長：174cm\n髪の色：白金　瞳の色：金と紫のバイカラー\n職業：声楽家\nイメージカラー：ラヴァンダ\nモチーフ：アメトリン(宝石)\n\n金色の長い髪を一部三つ編みにしている、イタリア出身の青年。三つ編みは計4束。31歳には見えない。\n子供の頃は聖歌隊に入隊し、今は声楽家として仕事をしている。ヒールを履いていることが多い。\nピッツァやラザニアなど、チーズ料理が好き。\n\n------\n\n記載URLにキャラクターデザインを貼っております。資料にある大人の姿を描いていただけると嬉しいです。\nほか資料で見えない部分や服装、表情などはお好きに描いていただいて大丈夫です！\n\n難しかったり、情報や金額が足りなければ、遠慮なくキャンセル、再送依頼していただいて構いません。\nご検討よろしくお願いします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1hU3UPRaXMvODxSGdyR0xvzAZp90Zwhai", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kimidori_17_17/works/34", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/70628364/uploads/origins/2c045d3b-df02-4695-8a2a-3c96b8536b4a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9418905245beea9d141aba827f57d822", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/70628364/uploads/origins/2c045d3b-df02-4695-8a2a-3c96b8536b4a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9418905245beea9d141aba827f57d822, https://si.imgix.net/70628364/uploads/origins/2c045d3b-df02-4695-8a2a-3c96b8536b4a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0282b363f92ed93742c03b7e5803b524 2x, https://si.imgix.net/70628364/uploads/origins/2c045d3b-df02-4695-8a2a-3c96b8536b4a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fc68cf384a6de88663b54ffb81248a6f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I love your art.\n\nI was wondering if I could get a piece featuring a child Takasugi Shinsaku (Fate/Grand Order) with his first ascension hair and a young Amagi Rinne (Ensemble Stars!!) as a child in his Ainu-esque clothing? The crossover scenario could feature a small scene between them. For example, Rinne holding his hand out to sickly child Shinsaku who is sitting on the engawa, or maybe the two of them are running into the forest while holding hands. Ideally, Rinne is acting like an older brother to the frailer Shinsaku. I leave the aesthetics of the scenario in your hands.\n\nThank you for your consideration. Your Takasugi drawings are my favorite!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kimidori_17_17/works/33", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6066230d/uploads/origins/9bf7cc80-54a0-48bd-bd38-f57ef576ad81?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=807f7275d116911c6a5c96bd8d62de49", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6066230d/uploads/origins/9bf7cc80-54a0-48bd-bd38-f57ef576ad81?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=807f7275d116911c6a5c96bd8d62de49, https://si.imgix.net/6066230d/uploads/origins/9bf7cc80-54a0-48bd-bd38-f57ef576ad81?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e8e93068e23626bd85a87a05b12c06f7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6066230d/uploads/origins/9bf7cc80-54a0-48bd-bd38-f57ef576ad81?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=fedff9fdb6b564521d3e972aab6e19b5 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kimidori_17_17/works/32", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5ba441a4/uploads/origins/343cb4f2-7cb3-443b-b5e2-f4752f7d920f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=b0819a514d7e2e504